  "title": "Baked Fettuccine Lasagna",
  "description": "Creamy, comforting baked fettuccine lasagna combines sautéed onion and peppers with ground beef, tomatoes, and more, layered with pasta and cheese.",
  "authors": [
    "MARBALET"
  ],
